# ViAna Engine Rules

- Do not modify `legacy/inference/inference_engine.py` except for path fixes; it is the parity reference.
- New code lives under `src/viana/`.
- CLI-first: every stage must be invocable via `python -m viana`.
- Use `JobSubmitRequest` / Pydantic models from `src/viana/config/job.py`.
- Output artifacts under `{output.parent_dir}/{project_id}/` via `src/viana/io/paths.py`.
- No analytics (15-min bins) inside the GPU frame loop — write events CSV only.
- `horizon_line` and `counting_line` are mandatory; validate frame bounds.
- Heuristic truck split behind `use_heuristic_truck_split` flag.
- Class hierarchy from `configs/classes.yaml` only.
- Parity procedure: see `legacy/PARITY.md`.
